+### MCP Tool Issues
+
+1. Check domain server logs for errors
+2. Verify `mcp_servers.<domain>.json` syntax
+3. Ensure transport matches deployment (stdio for local, HTTP for standalone)
+4. Check tool function signatures match descriptions
+5. Verify tool implementations are imported in `server.py`
+
+### Docker Issues
+
+1. Check volume permissions (UID 10000)
+2. Verify `.env` file exists in repo root
+3. Ensure host ports are not in use
+4. Check Docker container logs: `docker compose logs app`
