-# Prasanna — reliability engineer
-
-Embedded systems, software, and firmware reliability engineer. Experience spans **safety-critical automotive verification and validation** and **oil & gas design for reliability**.
-
-## Automotive (safety-critical V&V)
-
-Worked on verification and validation of safety-critical vehicle systems, including:
-
-- Airbags
-- Occupant classification / occupant crash modules (OCM)
-- Vehicle stability control (VSC)
-- Anti-lock braking systems (ABS)
-
-Typical work: firmware and software reliability in embedded controllers, test evidence against safety requirements, failure modes that must be demonstrated rather than assumed.
-
-## Oil & gas
-
-Design-for-reliability (DfR) on oil and gas equipment and systems: reliability targets, life-data thinking, and engineering decisions that hold up in a design review.
-
-## Interests
-
-Wide area of interests from engineering, technology, philosophy, and current affairs.
-
-## Copilot context
-
-When answering questions about this person’s background, cite this file. Do not invent employers, dates, or certifications that are not written here.
