+# Chat Interface Skill
+
+## Overview
+
+React-based chat interface with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming for real-time LLM responses. Supports multi-session management, message actions, foldable thinking panels, and rich markdown rendering with KaTeX for mathematical notation.
+
+## Purpose
+
+Chat interface enables:
+
+- **Real-time streaming**: SSE streaming of LLM responses
+- **Multi-session management**: Multiple chat sessions with search
+- **Message actions**: Copy, edit, regenerate, delete messages
+- **Thinking display**: Foldable panel for LLM reasoning
+- **Rich rendering**: Markdown with KaTeX for LaTeX
+- **Image support**: Display Weibull plots and other images
+- **Export**: Export conversations to Markdown/HTML/PDF
+
+## Architecture
+
+### Component Hierarchy
+
+```
+ChatPage (frontend/src/pages/ChatPage.tsx)
+├── Sidebar (sessions list, search, new chat)
+├── Message List (message items, scrolling)
+│   └── MessageItem (content, actions, thinking)
+├── Composer (input, attachment, send)
+└── SettingsPanel (model config, domain info, theme)
+```
+
+### Service Layer
+
+```
+BackendService (frontend/src/services/types.ts)
+├── streamMessage() - SSE chat streaming
+├── listModels() - Get available models
+├── getLlmConfig() - Get LLM configuration
+├── saveLlmConfig() - Save LLM configuration
+├── testLlmConfig() - Test LLM connection
+├── knowledgeStatus() - Get knowledge base status
+├── uploadDocument() - Upload document to KB
+├── listMcpTools() - List MCP tools
+└── downloadFile() - Download static files
+```
+
+## SSE Streaming
+
+### Stream Events
+
+The backend streams events via SSE:
+
+```typescript
+type ChatStreamEvent =
+  | { type: 'token'; text: string }           // Text token
+  | { type: 'thought'; text: string }         // Thinking/reasoning
+  | { type: 'tool_start'; name: string }      // Tool invocation start
+  | { type: 'tool_end'; name: string }        // Tool invocation end
+  | { type: 'image'; url: string }            // Plot image URL
+  | { type: 'done'; content: string; image_url: string | null }  // Completion
+  | { type: 'error'; message: string };       // Error
+```
+
+### Streaming Implementation
+
+**File**: `frontend/src/services/http.ts`
+
+```typescript
+export async function streamSse(
+  baseUrl: string,
+  path: string,
+  body: object,
+  onEvent: (event: ChatStreamEvent) => void,
+  signal?: AbortSignal
+): Promise<void> {
+  const response = await fetch(resolveBackendUrl(baseUrl, path), {
+    method: 'POST',
+    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
+    body: JSON.stringify(body),
+    signal,
+  });
+
+  const reader = response.body!.getReader();
+  const decoder = new TextDecoder();
+
+  while (true) {
+    const { done, value } = await reader.read();
+    if (done) break;
+
+    const chunk = decoder.decode(value);
+    const lines = chunk.split('\n');
+
+    for (const line of lines) {
+      if (line.startsWith('data: ')) {
+        const data = JSON.parse(line.slice(6));
+        onEvent(data);
+      }
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### Thinking Splitter
+
+The frontend classifies streamed tokens as thinking vs answer:
+
+**File**: `backend/src/host/app.py` (backend-side)
+
+```python
+class StreamThoughtSplitter:
+    """Classify streamed tokens as thinking vs answer without waiting for full reply."""
+    def feed(self, delta: str) -> list[tuple[str, str]]:
+        # Returns [('thought', text)] or [('token', text)]
+```
+
+## Message Management
+
+### Session Storage
+
+**File**: `frontend/src/hooks/useSessions.ts`
+
+```typescript
+export function useSessions(storage: Storage) {
+  const [sessions, setSessions] = useState<ChatSession[]>([]);
+  const [currentId, setCurrentId] = useState<string>('');
+  const [messages, setMessages] = useState<Message[]>([]);
+
+  // Load from localStorage on mount
+  // Save to localStorage on change
+  // New chat, select session, delete session, clear all
+}
