+
+## Settings Panel
+
+### LLM Configuration
+
+**Fields**:
+- Provider (Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, OpenAI, custom)
+- Base URL
+- API key (write-only, not persisted in localStorage)
+- Model selection
+- Temperature
