+
+## Theme Support
+
+### Theme Options
+
+**File**: `frontend/src/hooks/useTheme.ts`
+
+**Options**:
+- **System**: Follow OS light/dark setting
+- **Light**: Always light theme
+- **Dark**: Always dark theme
+
+**Implementation**:
+```typescript
+const [choice, setChoice] = useState<ThemeChoice>('system');
+
+useEffect(() => {
+  const prefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;
+  const isDark = choice === 'dark' || (choice === 'system' && prefersDark);
+  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-bs-theme', isDark ? 'dark' : 'light');
+}, [choice]);
+```
+
+### CSS Variables
+
+**File**: `frontend/src/styles.css`
+
+```css
+:root {
+  --bg-primary: #ffffff;
+  --text-primary: #212529;
+}
+
+[data-bs-theme="dark"] {
+  --bg-primary: #212529;
+  --text-primary: #f8f9fa;
+}
+```
+
+## Performance Characteristics
+
+### Streaming Performance
+
+- **First token**: < 500ms (LLM latency)
+- **Token rate**: 10-50 tokens/second (depends on LLM)
+- **UI responsiveness**: Smooth with 60fps rendering
+- **Memory**: Linear with message count
+
+### Rendering Performance
+
+- **Markdown rendering**: < 100ms per message
+- **MathJax rendering**: < 200ms per message
+- **Image loading**: < 500ms (depends on image size)
+
+## Best Practices
+
+### Streaming
+
+1. **Use SSE**: Prefer SSE over polling for real-time updates
+2. **Handle errors**: Display error messages to user
+3. **Support cancellation**: Use AbortSignal for cancellation
+4. **Buffer display**: Don't render every token immediately (buffer small bursts)
+
+### Message Management
+
+1. **Limit history**: Don't keep unlimited session history
+2. **Use localStorage**: Persist sessions for continuity
+3. **Auto-save**: Save on every message
+4. **Search**: Enable session search for navigation
+
+### Rendering
+
+1. **Sanitize HTML**: Use rehype-sanitize for security
+2. **Lazy load images**: Load images as they appear
+3. **Debounce MathJax**: Don't render on every token
+4. **Use virtual scrolling**: For very long conversations
+
